On Sunday, April 14, 2013 11:16:42 PM UTC-4, Daniel Lee wrote:<blockquote class="gmail_quote" style="margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex"><div dir="ltr"><div>Hi Ben,<br><br></div>Sorry, but can you explain what this output is supposed to tell us? It looks like there are a lot of non-issues in here. For example:<br><br><div><pre>src/stan/math/matrix/typedefs.hpp:9:66: error: no type named &#39;size_type&#39; in &#39;Eigen::Matrix&lt;double, -1, -1, 0, -1, -1&gt;&#39;
    typedef Eigen::Matrix&lt;double,Eigen::Dynamic,Eigen::Dynamic&gt;::size_type size_type;
<br><div style="background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word"><code><div><span>git show </span><span style="color:rgb(0,102,102)">5911afb</span><span><br>
</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">...</span><span><br></span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">-</span><span>    </span><span style="color:rgb(0,0,136)">typedef</span><span> </span><span style="color:rgb(102,0,102)">Eigen</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">::</span><span style="color:rgb(102,0,102)">Matrix</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">&lt;</span><span style="color:rgb(0,0,136)">double</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">,</span><span style="color:rgb(102,0,102)">Eigen</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">::</span><span style="color:rgb(102,0,102)">Dynamic</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">,</span><span style="color:rgb(102,0,102)">Eigen</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">::</span><span style="color:rgb(102,0,102)">Dynamic</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">&gt;::</span><span>size_type size_type</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">;</span><span><br>
</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">+</span><span>    </span><span style="color:rgb(0,0,136)">typedef</span><span> size_t size_type</span><span style="color:rgb(102,102,0)">;</span><span><br></span></div>
</code></div></pre><br></div><div>This comes from us extending Eigen&#39;s base type with an EigenDenseMatrixPlugin so we can exchange std::vector and Eigen (row-)vectors and use appropriate types for indexing. <br></div></div></blockquote>
